=Review the following GitHub pull request and produce a concise, actionable code review.

PR #{{$json.prNumber}}: {{$json.title}}
Author: {{$json.author}}
Branch: {{$json.headBranch}} -> {{$json.baseBranch}}
Files changed: {{$json.changedFiles}} | +{{$json.additions}} / -{{$json.deletions}}
Diff URL: {{$json.diffUrl}}

PR description:
{{$json.body}}

Static validation notes (already flagged, do not repeat unless relevant):
{{JSON.stringify($json.staticIssues)}}

Return a JSON object only (no markdown, no code fences) with this shape:
{
  "summary": "one paragraph overview of what this PR does",
  "riskLevel": "LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH",
  "strengths": ["..."],
  "concerns": ["..."],
  "suggestedNextSteps": ["..."]
}

